What this repository contains
-----------------------------

This repository contains the recommendation engine only: source code, database
migrations, and documentation, all authored by Savante.


What this repository does NOT contain
-------------------------------------

No third-party content is redistributed here. Specifically, this repository does
not include, and must not be used to publish:

  - the workflow definitions, documentation, or source code of any third-party
    project;
  - the corpus that the engine indexes (it is held locally and `data/` is
    gitignored); or
  - any catalog, index, manifest, or other metadata derived from that corpus,
    including item names, categories, URLs, licenses, counts, and file paths.

The ingestion scripts are designed to run against a corpus that you supply and
hold yourself. Anything they produce (`out/catalog.json`, `out/stats.json`, and
the rows loaded into your database) is derived from your corpus and stays on
your infrastructure.

If you point this engine at third-party material, you are responsible for
complying with the licenses of that material. Aggregating or indexing a source
does not grant you the right to redistribute it.
